---
import { Button } from "@/components/starwind/button";
import IconText from '../fragments/IconText.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---


<section class="flex gap-10 px-20 justify-center items-center h-screen">
    <div class="basis-1/2 space-y-5">
        <div class="flex gap-1 items-center border rounded-full w-fit py-1 px-3 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-600">
            <Icon name="fluent:checkmark-starburst-20-filled" class="size-5 text-emerald-500" />
            <p class="font-medium">Terakreditasi Paripurna • FKTP Kemenkes RI</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold">Layanan Kesehatan Komprehensif, Terpercaya & Sepenuh Hati untuk Warga Medan.</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-zinc-500">Melayani dengan filosofi 3S (Senyum, Sapa, Sentuh). Kami hadir memberikan penanganan medis primer terbaik dengan sinergi 10+ dokter berpengalaman, fasilitas mutakhir, serta jam operasional panjang hingga malam hari.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
            <Button variant="primary">Hubungi Kami</Button>
            <Button variant="outline">Lihat Layanan</Button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-5 text-zinc-500">
            <IconText
                iconName="fluent:checkmark-circle-20-regular" 
                text="Menerima Pasien BPJS & Umum"
            />
            <IconText
                iconName="fluent:checkmark-circle-20-regular" 
                text="Rekam Medis Terkomputerisasi (RME)"
            />
            <IconText
                iconName="fluent:checkmark-circle-20-regular" 
                text="Layanan Home Visite"
            />
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="basis-1/2 bg-zinc-200 size-full max-h-[70dvh] rounded-tr-4xl rounded-bl-4xl"></div>
</section>